From 62291e6448a00089c7b326ee3565c5502768fefd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taimoor Ul Islam <tislam@iastate.edu>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 14:40:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/53] kaiair: add PktR feedback view on gNB (Tier-A,
 display-only)

Surface the per-UE feedback the scheduler already collects, annotated with how
PktR consumes it: UE-reported CQI (-> DL SINR working point) and DL HARQ
(-> reliability/BLER target beta), and gNB-measured UL PUSCH SINR & RSRP
(-> receiver interference+noise NI = RSRP - SINR, the Cantelli power input).

New file kaiair_pktr_metrics_view.{h,cpp}; thin env-gated hook
(KAIAIR_PKTR_METRICS=1) appended to the stdout scheduler-metrics consumer.
No UE/PHY changes; computes nothing the scheduler acts on yet, first step of
Phase 1 measurement surfacing for the team demo.
